## Title: GogoLoot
## Notes: Speedy auto loot empties corpses without the loot window, auto rolls Need, Greed, or Pass by quality, and master looting hands out drops for you. Clams, containers, and unlocked lockboxes open on their own. Loot faster, pull sooner.
